ParentVault_deployment
├── roles
│   └── it should grant expected vault roles
├── proxy
│   ├── it should deploy vault as separate implementation and proxy contracts
│   └── it should hand off vault default admin
├── core addresses
│   └── it should configure vault addresses from deployment config
├── share
│   └── it should configure share initial state
├── adapters
│   ├── it should register Aave V3, Aave V4, and Compound V3 adapters
│   ├── it should configure deployed adapters
│   └── it should configure AdapterRegistry roles
├── protocol support
│   └── it should support Aave V3, Aave V4, and Compound V3 protocol IDs
├── CCIP config
│   ├── it should set the default CCIP gas limit
│   └── it should leave the parent chain selector unregistered
├── initial active adapter
│   └── it should set Aave V3 as the initial active adapter
└── workflow router
    └── it should configure constructor-granted router roles
